</Folder>
<Folder><name>Day 12 · Sun 6 Dec · Fly home</name>
<Placemark><name>D12.1 Breakfast</name><styleUrl>#d11</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>08:00–10:00</b> Breakfast, pack, final convenience-store run<br>Cost: Breakfast in package<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Comfort%20Hotel%20Tokyo%20Higashi%20Nihombashi">Open in Google Maps</a><br>Photo: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi">Nihonbashi (Wikipedia)</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>139.7843,35.6922,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>D12.2+3 Check in</name><styleUrl>#d11</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<b>11:15–14:25</b> Check in, tax-free shopping, Royce at the airport<br>Cost: You pay: shopping<br><br><b>14:25–00:50</b> CX527 → Hong Kong, CX601 → Hyderabad (arrives 00:50, 7 Dec)<br>Assumes Cathay has the same flights on 6 Dec; the agent has to re-quote.<br>Cost: In package (date change)<br><br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Narita%20International%20Airport%20Terminal%202">Open in Google Maps</a><br>Your reel: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DZhFeZzxypD/">@Sayli Chaudhari</a> – Snacks to buy: Japanese KitKats, Royce, Black Thunder, Ohayo pudding<br>Photo: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narita_International_Airport">Narita International Airport (Wikipedia)</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>140.3929,35.772,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Day 12 route</name><styleUrl>#d11</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[Straight lines between stops, in order. Directions: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Comfort%20Hotel%20Tokyo%20Higashi%20Nihombashi/Narita%20International%20Airport%20Terminal%202">open in Google Maps</a>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>139.7843,35.6922,0 140.3929,35.772,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
